				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Join a veteran-owned team that&#8217;s redefining </span><a href="https://prestigeer.com/emergency-room-services/"><span style="font-weight: 400;">emergency care</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;"> across San Antonio. With </span><a href="https://prestigeer.com/locations/"><span style="font-weight: 400;">four locations</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;"> open 24/7, Prestige ER offers the chance to do meaningful work with people who take patient care seriously.</span></p>								</div>
